 its entries. Tape and MIDI Output cannot become layers and do not show the item. Tests cover position, order, automation, undo, nesting and the refused cases.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"andremichelle/openDAW","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-28T20:14:17Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"fca32aa45238965755d2bbd748fc4d0bff675d0d","github_link":"https://github.com/andremichelle/openDAW/commit/fca32aa45238965755d2bbd748fc4d0bff675d0d","commit_subject":"\"Add Instrument\" in an Instrument Composite and \"Add Effect\" in an FX Composite open the device dialog instead of a plain list. Every pick previews right away as a new layer or a new entry at the end, with presets, scripts, soundfonts and WebCLAPs to choose from. An instrument preset becomes a layer of its instrument, an effect chain preset fills a new entry. A preset that does not fit leaves no empty layer or entry behind. Tests cover what a new layer accepts and both ways of adding layers and entries.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"andremichelle/openDAW","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-28T20:14:17Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"730ee0057aae692386e83c882a5c4a1fb8557111","github_link":"https://github.com/andremichelle/openDAW/commit/730ee0057aae692386e83c882a5c4a1fb8557111","commit_subject":"Error triage entry for live error 1193, fixed in 915902207 and marked fixed in the error log.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"expertanalytics/rasputin","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-28T20:14:10Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"80acf385d6d6cc145afc46c6f407909ad2006bd2","github_link":"https://github.com/expertanalytics/rasputin/commit/80acf385d6d6cc145afc46c6f407909ad2006bd2","commit_subject":"Record design review round 1 of h38","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"Azure/azure-sdk-tools","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-28T20:14:00Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"db0e3a8b8c11b065eed14af1d906f697d3af1830","github_link":"https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-tools/commit/db0e3a8b8c11b065eed14af1d906f697d3af1830","commit_subject":"Release A